Name: ipc-channel
Short Name: ipc-channel
URL: https://github.com/servo/ipc-channel
Version: 0.23.1
Revision: f1214051be070ee51fcf4b9550b7015b3b942899
Update Mechanism: Manual (tools/import.py ipc-channel, history replayed linearly)
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
License File: N/A (see the crate manifests)
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
A multiprocess drop-in replacement for Rust channels

Local Modifications:
The crates (1) live in third_party/ipc-channel/<crate>, one directory per package; their manifests are rewritten by
tools/flatten.py (path dependencies, inlined workspace inheritance, one version per crate) and patched by
tools/fixups.sh and tools/patches/. Everything else of the upstream is in third_party/ipc-channel/ unchanged.

Crates:
  ipc-channel 0.23.1 third_party/ipc-channel/ipc-channel
